ney that comes from other states  through the federal government are  mississippi  kentucky south carolina louisiana  alabama tennessee arkansas and oklahoma  they're all  in what we would be this southern region  of the united states  texas and florida are kind of in the  middle they're not terrible they're not  great in terms of paying in versus  getting out  so the point here is the group that most  wants to secede from the united states  southern republicans  and make their own country out of their  region  are the ones who states are the least  economically able to do that  and the most dependent on blue states to  subsidize them this isn't new  we've covered this we've done stories  about this before about this contrast  before  it's been true for a very long time now  consider the reality versus perception  their perception is things are really  bad being part of the united states  why because of democrats and liberals  and progressives  like joe biden's communism and his  socialism  and the marxist democrats woke culture  is ruining us  cancel cultural culture is ruining us  men in girls  sports as they love to say it's ruining  the country  and we'd be better off if we separated  and did our own thing that's the  perception that many of them have  the reality is none of that stuff is  actually going on  there are almost no socialists in the  democratic party and however bad things  are in your state  in terms of education and they're very  bad in a lot of these states  however bad things are in your state in  terms of access to healthcare  infrastructure  it would be even worse if you lost the  subsidies you get from blue states  through the federal government  blue states that are paying in much more  than they get out  and making your education system be  slightly less terrible  making your health care system be  slightly less terrible  making your infrastructure slightly less  terrible it couldn't possibly be more  backwards and they have the idea these 